{"module":"grammar","item":{"id":"a2-grammar-dativ-akkusativ","level":"A2","topic":"Kasus","title":{"de":"Dativ und Akkusativ","bn":"Dativ ও Akkusativ"},"summary":"কাকে দেওয়া হচ্ছে (Dativ) আর কী দেওয়া হচ্ছে (Akkusativ), এবং তাদের article।","intro":[{"kind":"text","text":"এটা প্রথমে একটু কঠিন মনে হতে পারে। কিন্তু সহজ করে বুঝি।"},{"kind":"text","text":"ধরো, তুমি বন্ধুকে একটি বই দিলে।"},{"kind":"list","items":["কে দিল? — আমি।","কাকে দিলাম? — বন্ধুকে।","কী দিলাম? — বইটি।"]},{"kind":"text","text":"জার্মানে কাকে বোঝানো ব্যক্তিটি অনেক সময় Dativ হয়, আর কী দেওয়া হচ্ছে সেটি Akkusativ হয়।"}],"sections":[{"heading":"১. Dativ + Akkusativ","blocks":[{"kind":"examples","items":[{"de":"Ich gebe meinem Freund das Buch.","bn":"আমি আমার বন্ধুকে বইটি দিচ্ছি।"}]},{"kind":"table","rows":[["German","বাংলা","কাজ"],["Ich","আমি","কাজটি করছে"],["meinem Freund","আমার বন্ধুকে","Dativ"],["das Buch","বইটি","Akkusativ"],["gebe","দিচ্ছি","Verb"]]},{"kind":"text","text":"মনে রাখবে: geben (দেওয়া), schicken (পাঠানো), zeigen (দেখানো)—এ ধরনের verb-এ প্রায়ই একজন ব্যক্তি এবং একটি জিনিস থাকে।"}]},{"heading":"২. Dativ ও Akkusativ-এর article","blocks":[{"kind":"table","rows":[["Nominativ","Akkusativ","Dativ"],["der Mann","den Mann","dem Mann"],["die Frau","die Frau","der Frau"],["das Kind","das Kind","dem Kind"]]},{"kind":"text","text":"উদাহরণ:"},{"kind":"examples","items":[{"de":"Ich helfe dem Mann.","bn":"আমি লোকটিকে সাহায্য করি।"}]},{"kind":"text","text":"helfen verb-এর পরে Dativ হয়। তাই der Mann থেকে dem Mann হয়েছে।"},{"kind":"text","text":"গুরুত্বপূর্ণ: সব সময় „কাকে = Dativ“ নিয়মে চলবে না। helfen-এর মতো কিছু verb নিজেই Dativ চায়।"}]}],"test":[{"id":"a2-grammar-dativ-akkusativ-t1","type":"mcq","prompt":"„Ich gebe meinem Freund das Buch.“ এখানে Dativ কোনটি?","options":["das Buch","meinem Freund","Ich"],"answer":1,"explanation":"কাকে দিচ্ছি → meinem Freund (Dativ)।"},{"id":"a2-grammar-dativ-akkusativ-t2","type":"mcq","prompt":"„Ich gebe meinem Freund das Buch.“ এখানে Akkusativ কোনটি?","options":["das Buch","meinem Freund","gebe"],"answer":0,"explanation":"কী দিচ্ছি → das Buch (Akkusativ)।"},{"id":"a2-grammar-dativ-akkusativ-t3","type":"mcq","prompt":"der Mann → Dativ-এ কী হয়?","options":["den Mann","der Mann","dem Mann"],"answer":2,"explanation":"der → Dativ-এ dem।"},{"id":"a2-grammar-dativ-akkusativ-t4","type":"mcq","prompt":"die Frau → Dativ-এ কী হয়?","options":["der Frau","die Frau","den Frau"],"answer":0,"explanation":"die → Dativ-এ der।"},{"id":"a2-grammar-dativ-akkusativ-t5","type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich helfe ___ Mann.","options":["den","dem","der"],"answer":1,"explanation":"helfen নিজেই Dativ চায়: dem Mann।"},{"id":"a2-grammar-dativ-akkusativ-t6","type":"mcq","prompt":"das Kind → Akkusativ-এ কী হয়?","options":["dem Kind","den Kind","das Kind"],"answer":2,"explanation":"das Akkusativ-এ বদলায় না: das Kind।"}]},"schema":1,"id":"a2-grammar-dativ-akkusativ","level":"A2","test":[{"id":"a2-grammar-dativ-akkusativ-t1","type":"mcq","prompt":"„Ich gebe meinem Freund das Buch.“ এখানে Dativ কোনটি?","options":["das Buch","meinem Freund","Ich"],"answer":1,"explanation":"কাকে দিচ্ছি → meinem Freund (Dativ)।"},{"id":"a2-grammar-dativ-akkusativ-t2","type":"mcq","prompt":"„Ich gebe meinem Freund das Buch.“ এখানে Akkusativ কোনটি?","options":["das Buch","meinem Freund","gebe"],"answer":0,"explanation":"কী দিচ্ছি → das Buch (Akkusativ)।"},{"id":"a2-grammar-dativ-akkusativ-t3","type":"mcq","prompt":"der Mann → Dativ-এ কী হয়?","options":["den Mann","der Mann","dem Mann"],"answer":2,"explanation":"der → Dativ-এ dem।"},{"id":"a2-grammar-dativ-akkusativ-t4","type":"mcq","prompt":"die Frau → Dativ-এ কী হয়?","options":["der Frau","die Frau","den Frau"],"answer":0,"explanation":"die → Dativ-এ der।"},{"id":"a2-grammar-dativ-akkusativ-t5","type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich helfe ___ Mann.","options":["den","dem","der"],"answer":1,"explanation":"helfen নিজেই Dativ চায়: dem Mann।"},{"id":"a2-grammar-dativ-akkusativ-t6","type":"mcq","prompt":"das Kind → Akkusativ-এ কী হয়?","options":["dem Kind","den Kind","das Kind"],"answer":2,"explanation":"das Akkusativ-এ বদলায় না: das Kind।"}]}